    "source": "Vickie Y. Jo",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 708.7pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"945\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 3.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.15pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; mso-background-themecolor: text2; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tumour type</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 280.75pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; mso-background-themecolor: text2; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"374\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Immunocytochemistry (positive)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 280.8pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; mso-background-themecolor: text2; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"374\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Molecular genetics</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Ewing sarcoma</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 280.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"374\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CD99, NKX2-2</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 280.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"374\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">FET::ETS fusions: <em>EWSR1</em>::<em>FLI1</em>&nbsp;(85%); <em>EWSR1</em>::<em>ERG</em>&nbsp;(10%); <em>FUS</em>::<em>FLI1</em>, <em>FUS</em>::<em>ERG</em>, and other&nbsp;(rare) FET::ETS fusions&nbsp;(5%)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">NFATC2</span></em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">-rearranged sarcoma</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 280.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"374\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CD99 diffusely positive&nbsp;(~50%); keratin, EMA, NKX2-2, and NKX3-1&nbsp;(variably positive)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 280.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"374\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">EWSR1</span></em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">::<em>NFATC2</em>, <em>FUS</em>::<em>NFATC2</em>; <em>EWSR1</em> break-apart FISH shows amplification of 5&prime;&nbsp;probe</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em>CIC</em>-rearranged sarcoma</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 280.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"374\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CD99 variable&nbsp;(~85%), ETV4, WT1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 280.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"374\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>CIC</em>::<em>DUX4L8</em> (<em>DUX2</em>)&nbsp;(95%), <em>CIC</em>::<em>FOXO4</em>, <em>CIC</em>::<em>LEUTX</em>, <em>CIC</em>::<em>NUTM1</em>, <em>CIC</em>::<em>NUTM2A</em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.15pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Sarcoma with <em>BCOR</em>&nbsp;alterations</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 280.75pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"374\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CD99 variable&nbsp;(~50%), BCOR, cyclin&nbsp;B3&nbsp;(CCNB3), SATB2, cyclin&nbsp;D1, TLE1</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 280.8pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"374\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">BCOR</span></em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">::<em>CCNB3</em>&nbsp;(90%), <em>BCOR</em>::<em>MAML3</em>, <em>BCOR</em>&nbsp;internal&nbsp;tandem&nbsp;duplication&nbsp;(ITD)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
